        "original_id": "ed1e6c9b-4c99-5835-9f1c-973b727a0e92",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Son of the Pink Panther, The Pink Panther film series, the original 1963 The Pink Panther film\n- People: Burt Kwouk, Herbert Lom, Graham Stark, Claudia Cardinale\n- Roles: Cato\n\nFacts:\n- The original 1963 The Pink Panther film starred Claudia Cardinale.\n- Son of the Pink Panther is a 1993 continuation of The Pink Panther film series.\n- Son of the Pink Panther also features Pink Panther regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk, and Graham Stark, along with Claudia Cardinale from the original 1963 film.\n- Burt Kwouk, born Herbert Tsangtse Kwouk, was a British actor known for playing Cato in the Pink Panther films.\n- Burt Kwouk was born on 18 July 1930 and died on 24 May 2016.",
